  "factor_name": "Drawdown Recovery Curvature Reversal 60D",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "-(drawdown_60 * (1 - recovery_fraction_60)), lagged 1 completed session",
    "description": "For each tradable asset, drawdown_60 is close divided by the rolling 60-session high minus one. recovery_fraction_60 is (close minus rolling 60-session low) divided by (rolling 60-session high minus rolling 60-session low). The negative product emphasizes deeply drawn-down and incompletely recovered assets as a contrarian reversal signal. Values are shifted by one session to prevent look-ahead.",
